      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7324419",
      "subQuestName": "Check on Benben",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732441001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732441001": {
            "id": "732441001",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Look, it's Benben!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441002"
            ]
          },
          "732441002": {
            "id": "732441002",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "I'm glad Aderfi didn't get to take Benben away...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441003"
            ]
          },
          "732441003": {
            "id": "732441003",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Or perhaps you could say that everything here looks exactly the same as before.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441004"
            ]
          },
          "732441004": {
            "id": "732441004",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Did he really think he'd overturn the Matriarch and return to his tent safe and sound...? What a self-absorbed idiot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441005"
            ]
          },
          "732441005": {
            "id": "732441005",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "But thanks to that, nothing bad happened to Benben.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441006"
            ]
          },
          "732441006": {
            "id": "732441006",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You call this \"nothing bad\"? Ohh, poor Benben...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441009"
            ]
          },
          "732441009": {
            "id": "732441009",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, why is it lying on the ground...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441010"
            ]
          },
          "732441010": {
            "id": "732441010",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Anyway, what happened to Benben? Everything seemed fine the last time we saw it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441011"
            ]
          },
          "732441011": {
            "id": "732441011",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "After leaving Khaj-Nisut, Benben gradually grew weaker... It looked like its parts were malfunctioning, and the sound of its beeps was getting lower...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441012"
            ]
          },
          "732441012": {
            "id": "732441012",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Then it couldn't make any sounds or move at all. It felt as if I was watching its life slowly drain out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441013"
            ]
          },
          "732441013": {
            "id": "732441013",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "At that time, no one in the tribe knew what was going on with Benben except Aderfi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441014"
            ]
          },
          "732441014": {
            "id": "732441014",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "So I left Benben in his care...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441015"
            ]
          },
          "732441015": {
            "id": "732441015",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh no... Is Benben gonna stay like this forever...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441016"
            ]
          },
          "732441016": {
            "id": "732441016",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441017"
            ]
          },
          "732441017": {
            "id": "732441017",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "At the very least, Benben's still here with us. I'm sure we'll find a way to fix it, sooner or later...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441018"
            ]
          },
          "732441018": {
            "id": "732441018",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But there's nothing we can work with...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441019"
            ]
          },
          "732441019": {
            "id": "732441019",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Hmm, let me think. I remember Aderfi telling me that whatever's wrong with Benben, it's nothing too serious, and that it should be fixed within a few days...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441020"
            ]
          },
          "732441020": {
            "id": "732441020",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Knowing him, if he performed some kind of investigation, he would've definitely left records behind. Let's have a look around the area!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732441021"
            ]
          },
          "732441021": {
            "id": "732441021",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "If it really was \"nothing too serious\", maybe we could even try fixing Benben ourselves!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7324420",
      "subQuestName": "Investigate within the tent",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732442001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732442001": {
            "id": "732442001",
            "speakerId": 20724,
            "speakerName": "Benben",
            "text": "(Benben lies still on the ground without making any of its familiar beeping sounds.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7324403",
      "subQuestName": "View Letter",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732440301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732440301": {
            "id": "732440301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey look, there's something over here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440302"
            ]
          },
          "732440302": {
            "id": "732440302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Doesn't look like investigation records to Paimon. It looks more like... a letter.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440303"
            ]
          },
          "732440303": {
            "id": "732440303",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "A letter? Let's open it up and see what's written inside!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440304"
            ]
          },
          "732440304": {
            "id": "732440304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The letter says Benben simply ran out of energy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440305"
            ]
          },
          "732440305": {
            "id": "732440305",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now that Paimon thinks about it, Benben opened the gates to the Mausoleum of King Deshret for us and activated our clearance... It really helped a lot during our journey.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440306"
            ]
          },
          "732440306": {
            "id": "732440306",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "And even mechanical creatures like Benben get tired. Maybe it ran low on energy after doing so much for us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440307"
            ]
          },
          "732440307": {
            "id": "732440307",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "The letter mentioned something called Energy Transformation Capacitors, but I didn't see anything like that in the tent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440308"
            ]
          },
          "732440308": {
            "id": "732440308",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Could it be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440310",
              "732440313"
            ]
          },
          "732440310": {
            "id": "732440310",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Doesn't look like it. If they were meant for repairing Benben, why would he try to hide them? Wouldn't it be more intuitive to use them right away?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440311"
            ]
          },
          "732440311": {
            "id": "732440311",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Aha, I know! It must be because the transaction hasn't occurred yet!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440314"
            ]
          },
          "732440314": {
            "id": "732440314",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Aderfi didn't bring Benben to the transaction, so there shouldn't be any Energy Transformation Capacitors here anyway... There's only one question left: who did he strike the deal with?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732440315"
            ]
          },
          "732440315": {
            "id": "732440315",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Ha, that was a dumb question for me to ask. There's only one group outside the tribe he'll have dealings like this with..."
          },
          "732440313": {
            "id": "732440313",
            "speakerId": 20723,
            "speakerName": "Jeht",
            "text": "Ah, I know what you mean! The transaction hasn't even taken place!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
